---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
import Container from "@sarfas/ui/Container.astro";
import Header from "~/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "~/components/Footer.astro";

const title = "About — LickMe";
const description =
  "Why LickMe exists, and the small principles behind it.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path="/about">
  <Header />

  <main>
    <Container as="article" class="prose">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>
        Every improvising musician carries a private library of licks — short
        phrases stolen from records, lessons, and other players. Most of that
        library lives in the back of a notebook, or scribbled on the side of a
        chart, or just in muscle memory. It's hard to share, and harder to
        learn from someone else's.
      </p>

      <p>
        LickMe is one place to put them. Write a lick down. Tag it. Drop it in
        a key. Then watch what happens when other players take it into the
        wild — onto a bandstand, into a take, into a context you didn't
        imagine — and post a short video back to the page.
      </p>

      <p>
        The site is built around a few small principles:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Notation in the browser.</strong> ABC or plain text in;
          rendered notation out. Nothing to install.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Video is the proof.</strong> A lick is just a sketch until
          someone plays it inside a real song. The videos are the lesson.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Quiet by default.</strong> No counters in your face, no
          notifications, no algorithmic feed competing for your attention.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        LickMe is built by <a href="https://luke.sarfas.com">Luke Sarfas</a>.
        It is in active development; you can <a
          href="mailto:lukesarfas@icloud.com?subject=LickMe%20waitlist"
        >ask to be notified</a
        > when it opens up.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 680px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .prose h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .prose a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }
</style>
